request.description:
Authenticates a user (driver or manager) and returns a JWT access token.

Command: LoginCommand(PhoneNumber, Password)
Returns: Result<UserResultDto> → { isSuccess, token, role, fullName, ... }

Verifies the OTP code. On success, returns a JWT token AND a resetToken (valid 15 min) for password reset.

Command: VerifyOtpCommand(PhoneNumber, OtpCode)
Returns: VerifyOtpResultDto { isSuccess, token, resetToken, role, fullName }

Exchanges an existing (potentially expired) JWT token for a new one.

Command: RefreshTokenCommand(OldToken)
Returns: UserResultDto { isSuccess, token, role, fullName }

Retrieves the public profile for a user by phone number.

Query: GetProfileQuery(PhoneNumber)
Returns: { isSuccess, data: UserProfileDto }

Marks a trip as In-Progress, recording the start time.

Command: StartTripCommand(TripId, DriverId, PickupLocationId, DropoffLocationId)
Returns: Result<TripStartResultDto> { tripId, driverId, status, startedAt, pickupLocationId, dropoffLocationId }

Returns the live dispatch feed showing recent dispatch events.

Query: GetLiveDispatchFeedQuery(Limit, MinutesWindow)
Returns: Result<LiveDispatchFeedResultDto> { items[], totalCount, retrievedAt }

Returns trip counts and revenue grouped by hour of day to identify peak periods.

Query: GetPeakHoursQuery()
Returns: Result<List<TripPeakHoursDto>> { hour, tripCount, totalRevenue }

Returns daily trip counts, average fares and revenues (trend data for charting).

Query: GetTripTrendsQuery()
Returns: Result<List<TripTrendDto>> { periodLabel, tripCount, averageFare, totalRevenue }

Synchronizes batched offline trip data collected by a driver when offline.

Command: SyncOfflineDataCommand(DriverId, Trips: OfflineTripDto[])
OfflineTripDto: { localTripId, pickupLocationId, dropoffLocationId, startedAt, endedAt, actualFare }
Returns: Result<SyncSummaryDto> { receivedCount, syncedCount, failedCount, failedLocalTripIds }

Returns the complete list of NYC taxi zones.

Query: GetAllZonesQuery()
Returns: Result<List<ZoneDto>> { zoneId, zoneName, borough, serviceZone }

Returns summary metadata: total zones, total boroughs, borough breakdown.

Query: GetZoneMetadataQuery()
Returns: Result<ZoneMetadataDto> { totalZones, totalBoroughs, totalServiceZones, boroughCounts }

Returns geo-heatmap data for all zones: lat/lon, trip count, surge multiplier, demand level.

Query: GetHeatmapDataQuery()
Returns: Result<List<HeatmapDataPointDto>> { zoneId, zoneName, borough, latitude, longitude, tripCount, surgeMultiplier, demandLevel }

Compares statistics across multiple zones. Accepts repeated zoneIds query params.

Query: CompareZonesQuery(zoneIds: List<int>)
Returns: Result<ZoneComparisonDto> { comparisonData[], highestRevenueZone, busiestZone }

Returns trend data for a zone by hour or day.

Query: GetZoneTrendsQuery(ZoneId?, TrendType)
Returns: Result<List<ZoneTrendDto>> { timeLabel, tripCount, totalRevenue, avgFare }

Returns historical trip metrics for a zone within a date range.

Query: GetZoneHistoryQuery(ZoneId?, StartDate, EndDate)
Returns: Result<List<ZoneHistoryDto>> { date, totalTrips, totalRevenue, averageFare, peakHour }

Returns trip counts and revenue grouped by hour for a specific zone (or all zones).

Query: GetPeakHoursQuery(ZoneId?)
Returns: Result<List<PeakHoursDto>> { hour, tripCount, totalRevenue, averageFare }

Returns the top zones by pickup count.

Query: GetTopDemandZonesQuery(limit)
Returns: Result<List<TopDemandZoneDto>> { zoneId, zoneName, borough, pickupCount, percentageOfTotal }

Returns the top zones by total revenue generated.

Query: GetTopRevenueZonesQuery(limit)
Returns: Result<List<TopRevenueZoneDto>> { zoneId, zoneName, borough, totalRevenue, percentageOfTotal }

Returns zones with the highest driver stock-out probability.

Query: GetHighStockoutZonesQuery(limit)
Returns: Result<List<HighStockoutZoneDto>> { zoneId, zoneName, borough, pickupCount, availableDriversCount, deficitCount, stockoutProbability }

Predicts 6-hour demand for a list of zones.

Command: PredictDemand6hCommand(Zones: Demand6hInput[])
Returns: ApiResponse<BatchPredictionResponse<Demand6hResult>> { zoneId, p50, p90, confidenceIntervalLower, confidenceIntervalUpper }

Predicts revenue for a list of zones.

Command: PredictRevenueCommand(Zones: RevenueInput[])
Returns: ApiResponse<BatchPredictionResponse<RevenueResult>> { zoneId, p50, p90, expectedTotalRevenue }

Predicts stock-out probability for a list of zones.

Command: PredictStockOutCommand(Zones: StockOutInput[])
Returns: ApiResponse<BatchPredictionResponse<StockOutResult>> { zoneId, probability, willStockOut, riskLevel: Low|Medium|High|Critical }

Starts a faster-than-real-time simulation.

Body: SimulationStartRequest { durationHours (1-720), speedFactor (1-200), totalDrivers (1-10000), zoneCount (1-265), startTime }
Returns: ApiResponse<SimulationStatusResponse> { simulationId, status, simulatedTime, currentHour, speedFactor, isPaused }

Dynamically adjusts the simulation speed factor (1-200).

Body: SimulationSpeedRequest { speedFactor: double }
Returns: ApiResponse<SimulationStatusResponse>

Manually triggers aggregation of today's trip data into DailyStats.
Requires Manager role.

Returns: { success, message, timestamp }

Manually triggers aggregation for a specific past date.
Requires Manager role.

Returns: { success, message }
